@PrMap.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5229

### Is the API up?
GET {{PrMap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### A pasted pull request link. The server parses and validates the URL.
GET {{PrMap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/prs/files?url=https://github.com/octocat/Hello-World/pull/1
Accept: application/json

### The same pull request by its parts.
GET {{PrMap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/prs/octocat/Hello-World/1/files
Accept: application/json

### A link that is not a pull request. Expect 400 and a readable message.
GET {{PrMap.Api_HostAddress}}/api/prs/files?url=https://github.com/octocat/Hello-World
Accept: application/json
